At recording 90–92 s (route d≈36.7–39.1 m) the deck still showed big flat
env_sky_static_palette triangles (18.8 m², 76.3 m²). Subdivide 25 large upward
triangles near the late route coplanar (+472 verts, +686 tris) and add smooth
vertex-colour variation on 5,035 vertices (existing COLOR_0). Faces touching the
09 board-background frustum are locked. env_skycity.glb.meta: triangleCount
synced (foliage_cards 5790→8790 from 4c30cf7, palette 20028→23372).
